Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1789876799999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bar 90's 2771 high with a close 255.7 lower is a buy-climax bar, and the 29 bars since then overlap inside the range rather than trending - trading-range behavior after a climax.", "No close has exceeded 2771; the recent highs 2680 (bar 111) and 2700 (bar 119) are below the spike high, so the range top has already rejected the bulls.", "Bar 115 fell from 2517.53 to 2358.62 in a single bar, showing fast two-sided movement inside the range and poor trend persistence.", "The final bar closed 67.02 below its own 2700 high, so there is no acceptance yet at the upper boundary; the bull push is an in-range leg, not a confirmed breakout.", "The 2357.18 and 2358.62 lows are roughly equal, which marks a range floor that has been tested twice and can break rather than hold."], "evidence_for": ["Net window change is upward (open 2066.43 to close 2632.98) and the post-crash lows rose: 1368.42 (bar 14), 1512.91 (bar 34), 1803.74 (bar 55), 1821.49 (bar 72), 2357.18 (bar 102).", "Bar 88 broke out of a roughly 27-bar consolidation with a 377.29-point range (1905.63-2293.8) closing at 2252.16, and bars 89-90 followed through to 2771, satisfying the breakout-plus-follow-through test.", "Price holds well above the breakout: the last close 2632.98 is about 38% above bar 88's 1905.63 low and has not returned to bar 89's 2111 low.", "The most recent leg is bull: four consecutive higher closes off the 2358.62 double-bottom retest, and bar 119's 2632.98 is the highest close in the supplied window.", "The post-spike range has held above the spike bar's 2325.31 low and keeps making higher swing lows inside the range (2357.18 then 2358.62 with a higher close)."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, open_time 1779494400000 to 1789776000000, with the decision at the close of the final bar (close_time 1789862399999).", "Window high is 2771 (bar 90, open_time 1787270400000); window low is 1368.42 (bar 14, open_time 1780704000000).", "Bars 10-14 (1780358400000-1780704000000) are five overlapping bear bars driving 2006.17 down to 1368.42; bar 14 closes 1568.55, about 200 points above its low, a sell-climax tail.", "Bar 88 (1787097600000) opens 1916.51 inside the prior consolidation and closes 2252.16 near its 2293.8 high; bars 89-90 close 2326.32 and 2515.3, and bar 90 prints 2771 and closes 255.7 below that high.", "Bars 91-119 overlap between 2357.18 (bar 102 low, 1788307200000) and 2700 (bar 119 high); bar 90's low of 2325.31 was never revisited.", "Roughly equal lows at 2357.18 (bar 102) and 2358.62 (bar 115, 1789430400000) form a double bottom at the range low, followed by four higher closes (2416.57, 2446.22, 2612.02, 2632.98).", "The final bar's close 2632.98 is the highest close in the whole window, while its high 2700 stays 71 below bar 90's 2771 high; the last bar closes 67.02 under its own high."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear leg into a sell climax: bars 0-14 decline from bar 0's 2143.61 high to bar 14's 1368.42 low; the final bars are large bear trend bars and bar 14 closes 200.13 above its low.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779494400000, "upper_boundary": "2143.61"}, {"description": "Two-sided consolidation (bars 61-87, about 27 bars): upper boundary is bar 65's 1974.46 high with repeated 1919-1938 highs; lower boundary is the triple equal low 1821.69/1821.59/1821.49 (bars 70-72). Bar 88 later opened at 1916.51 inside it before breaking out.", "end_time_ms": 1787183999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1821.49", "start_time_ms": 1784764800000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Three-bar bull spike (bars 88-90): 1916.51 to 2252.16 to 2326.32 to a 2515.3 close, with bar 90 reaching 2771 and closing 255.7 off the high - a buy-climax bar.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-climax trading range (bars 91-119): upper boundary 2771.00 with internal highs capped at 2557.46, 2537.57, 2680 and 2700; lower boundary 2357.18 (bar 102 low), retested at 2358.62 (bar 115).", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Recent bull leg: four consecutive bull closes from bar 115's 2358.62 low to bar 119's 2700 high; bar 119's close 2632.98 is the highest close of the window.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2771 followed by a bar holding above 2771 would confirm a bull breakout and move the read toward breakout-spike/channel.", "Rejection at 2700-2771 with a bear close back below 2604.75 keeps the range classification and supports rotation back toward the 2400 area.", "A close below 2357.18 would break the range's double bottom and shift the read toward a range breakdown or deeper bear leg.", "A close below 2111 (bar 89 low) or 1905.63 (bar 88 low) would negate the bull breakout structure and make the bear side the structural read.", "Continued overlapping bars closing between roughly 2400 and 2700 would keep phase as range and Always-In relevance low."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Nine consecutive closes above the 2544.63 range top (roughly 3% above it) is acceptance rather than a mere overshoot, and the window's highest closes (2640.01, 2636.28, 2633.54) all occurred in the final six bars.", "Price cleared both the 2609.02 prior swing high and the earlier 2680.00 spike high, and the last close 2632.98 is above every close in the preceding 114 bars, which argues for a bull trend rather than a range.", "The 2357.18/2358.62 double bottom with the 2544.63 top broken gives a measured-move context near 2730, so the stall at 2700.00 can be read as a pause at a target rather than a range top.", "Rising lows since 2370.54 and only small down closes in the last fifteen bars keep the Always-In long, and no bar has yet closed back inside the range."], "evidence_for": ["About 100 of the 120 bars overlap between 2357.18 and 2544.63, with repeated failures at 2528.80, 2537.57, 2544.63 and 2545.29; the window's center of gravity is a wide two-sided range, not a sustained directional move.", "Upside probes in this window have not held: the 2680.00 bar (open_time 1789128000000) and the 2609.02 bar (open_time 1789416000000) both reversed back into the range, and the latter preceded a decline to 2358.62.", "The advance from 2370.54 is a single 18-bar leg; there is no prior pullback-and-higher-high channel sequence to confirm it, and its two largest bars are spike-type bars closing near their highs.", "After the spike the last four bars are a tight doji cluster with a 2700.00 upper tail, i.e., two-sided trading at the high instead of follow-through trend bars."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens 2407.00 and closes 2632.98; the highest close of the 120 bars is 2640.01 (open_time 1789819200000) and the highest high is 2700.00 (open_time 1789804800000, close 2638.49, upper tail 61.51).", "Largest recent bull bars: open_time 1789732800000 (O 2507.15, H 2585.50, L 2495.82, C 2578.60) and open_time 1789747200000 (O 2579.97, H 2643.52, L 2578.44, C 2636.28), each closing in the top 10% of its range.", "Window low 2357.18 (open_time 1788336000000) and a second low 2358.62 (open_time 1789488000000); the bars between them are dominated by overlap and repeated highs at 2528.80, 2537.57, 2544.63 and 2545.29.", "The bar with open_time 1789128000000 printed a 2680.00 high and closed 2555.52; the next bar closed 2538.73 and price reached 2358.62 within 25 bars, so that upside probe failed.", "The bar with open_time 1789416000000 printed a 2609.02 high and closed 2514.07 (upper tail 94.95); price then fell to 2358.62.", "Last four bars (open_times 1789804800000, 1789819200000, 1789833600000, 1789848000000) have bodies +11.96, +1.42, -6.47, -0.56 and hold the band 2618.80-2658.79 apart from the 2700.00 spike high.", "Nine consecutive closes (open_times 1789732800000 through 1789848000000) are above the 2544.63 range top; none has closed back inside.", "Rising lows on the current leg: 2370.54 (open_time 1789574400000), 2495.82 (1789732800000), 2604.75 (1789776000000), 2618.80 (1789848000000)."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Wide two-sided range that contains most of the window: low 2357.18 (open_time 1788336000000) with a second low 2358.62, bounded by repeated highs at 2528.80, 2537.57, 2544.63 and 2545.29; upside overshoots to 2609.02 and 2680.00 reversed back inside. Ends with the breakout bar open_time 1789732800000.", "end_time_ms": 1789718400000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788192000000, "upper_boundary": "2544.63"}, {"description": "One-bar buy spike: open 2457.12, high 2680.00, close 2555.52 (range 235.81), immediately followed by a bar that closed 2538.73 near its low 2503.25; the probe was not sustained and price returned to 2358.62 within 25 bars.", "end_time_ms": 1789156799999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2444.19", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Current bull spike: two large bull trend bars (2507.15 to 2578.60, then 2579.97 to 2636.28) broke above the 2544.63 range top and the 2609.02 prior swing high, with follow-through to a 2700.00 window high; nine consecutive closes sit above 2544.63 and none has closed back inside.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2495.82", "start_time_ms": 1789732800000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Tight pause at the window high after the spike: four small-body bars (open_times 1789804800000 to 1789848000000) holding 2618.80-2658.79 apart from the single 2700.00 probe; two-sided doji activity rather than trending follow-through.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2618.8", "start_time_ms": 1789804800000, "upper_boundary": "2658.79"}, {"description": "Wide double bottom 20 days apart: 2357.18 (open_time 1788336000000) and 2358.62 (open_time 1789488000000), the two window lows that frame the range; the 2544.63 range top break sits above them.", "end_time_ms": 1789488000000, "kind": "other", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788336000000, "upper_boundary": null}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close back below 2544.63 would confirm the range-top breakout failed and restore the wide-range read (bull trap).", "A bar closing above 2700.00 near its high would shift the primary regime from trading-range to bull-trend and mark the spike as the start of a channel.", "A close below the 2495.82 low of the first breakout bar would break the spike's structure and put the 2604.75/2618.80 higher lows at risk.", "Continued tight 2618.80-2658.79 overlap with no new high would leave the read as a breakout-spike pause, i.e., a possible final flag inside the larger range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2490.34", "close_time_ms": 1789448399999, "high": "2499.14", "low": "2488.87"